0 // Pair: fixed 4275b at origin; 4276b rotates by 180 deg around vertical Y (to face outward) then 22 deg around hinge axis world Z.
0 // Hinge pivot world = (20,4,0), centres coincide numerically, nominal rotation 22 deg.
0 // Fixed hinge studs onto 3004 top at Y=8; sloped hinge studs onto 87079 underside; idealized stud-grid alignment.
0 // This demonstrates a NOMINAL mating hinge pair; real clearance, pin engagement, roof load and LEGO clutch strength are NOT verified.
